# Frontend Rules

## Stack
React 19, Vite 7, TailwindCSS 4, Framer Motion, Wouter (routing), TanStack React Query v5

## Route map
```
/               → redirect to /pops
/pops           → PopsView (Pops' zero-touch display, auto-refreshes 30s)
/jessica        → JessicaPhone (live Gemini call + SSE streaming)
/scripts        → JessicaView (terminal-style script manifest)
/admin          → AdminView (Raymo's dashboard — 7 tabs)
/admin/report   → DoctorReport
/smarthome      → SmartHomePanel
/intercom       → E2EE intercom
/my-subscription→ MySubscriptionPage
/guardian       → GuardianPage (public — outside VaultGate)
/guardian/success → GuardianSuccessPage
```

## Vault gate
VaultProvider wraps all of AppContent. If isUnlocked === false, only VaultGate renders.
/guardian and /guardian/success are intentionally outside the vault for public subscriber onboarding.
Never move a page outside VaultProvider without explicit approval.

## Adding a page
1. Create `artifacts/brain-app/src/pages/<page>.tsx`
2. Add `<Route>` in App.tsx inside AppContent
3. Optionally add to NAV_ITEMS for bottom nav

## Mobile PWA pass scope (branch: mobile-admin-pwa-pass)
Phase 1: PWA manifest + safe areas + remove maximum-scale=1 + 16px inputs
Phase 2: Admin mobile layout — tab bar/drawer, hide global bottom nav on /admin, stack cards, contain tables
Phase 3: Jessica mobile polish — compact call header, keyboard-safe input, admin test mode
No native iOS. PWA only.
